# main-tema-vision: the real main screen under the builtin "VISION" theme (big
# type for weak eyes: every font three sizes up through fonts_scale(), a low top
# bar, a tall frequency strip, the S-meter on a row of its own). It is the theme
# the icon-glyph and layout findings of the UI-03 audit need: the scaled fonts
# are ASCII, so the labels that draw with sony_20/sony_30 lose the icon glyphs,
# and the fixed 56x26 cells of the top bar no longer fit their text. Same radio
# state as home-usb-20m, so the only variable is the theme.

name main-tema-vision
screen main

theme VISION
seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
